#: ../../source/api/core.rst:2
msgid "xent-core"
msgstr "xent-core"

#: ../../../xent-core/include/xent/xent.h:17
#: ../../../xent-core/include/xent/xent.h:24
msgid "Fails while an observer is running."
msgstr "生命周期观察者正在执行期间调用将返回失败。"

#: ../../../xent-core/include/xent/xent.h:19
msgid "Destroys the subtree. Fails while an observer is running."
msgstr "销毁整棵子树。生命周期观察者正在执行期间调用将返回失败。"

#: ../../../xent-core/include/xent/xent.h:22
msgid ""
"Detaches `child` from its current parent and appends it. Fails while an "
"observer is running, or if `child` is an ancestor of `parent`."
msgstr "将 `child` 从当前父节点分离并追加到 `parent` 末尾。观察者执行期间或 `child` 为 `parent` 祖先时返回失败。"

#: ../../../xent-core/include/xent/xent.h:27
msgid ""
"`before == XENT_NODE_INVALID` appends. `child` must have no parent. Fails"
" while an observer is running, or if `child` is an ancestor of `parent`."
msgstr ""
"当 `before == XENT_NODE_INVALID` 时追加到末尾。要求 `child` 尚无父节点；观察者执行期间或 `child` 为 `parent` 祖先时返回失败。"

#: ../../../xent-core/include/xent/xent.h:29
msgid ""
"`before == XENT_NODE_INVALID` moves to the end. `child` must already be "
"under `parent`. Fails while an observer is running."
msgstr "当 `before == XENT_NODE_INVALID` 时移至末尾。要求 `child` 已位于 `parent` 之下；观察者执行期间返回失败。"

#: ../../../xent-core/include/xent/xent.h:31
msgid ""
"`before == XENT_NODE_INVALID` appends. `child` must already have a "
"different parent. Fails while an observer is running, or if `child` is an"
" ancestor of `new_parent`."
msgstr ""
"当 `before == XENT_NODE_INVALID` 时追加到末尾。要求 `child` 原先挂在另一个父节点下；观察者执行期间或 `child` 为 `new_parent` 祖先时返回失败。"

#: ../../../xent-core/include/xent/xent.h:34
msgid ""
"Borrows `observer->userdata` until `xent_node_delobs` or "
"`xent_ctx_destroy`."
msgstr "借用 `observer->userdata` 直至调用 `xent_node_delobs` 或 `xent_ctx_destroy` 。"

#: ../../../xent-core/include/xent/xent.h:39
msgid "Copies `label`. NULL is stored as an empty string. The caller may free it."
msgstr "拷贝 `label` （传入 NULL 时存为空字符串），调用方随后可释放原缓冲区。"

#: ../../../xent-core/include/xent/xent.h:65
msgid ""
"Borrowed until the next `xent_sem_setlabel` on this node, or until the "
"node is destroyed."
msgstr "借用指针有效至该节点下一次调用 `xent_sem_setlabel` 或节点销毁为止。"

#: ../../../xent-core/include/xent/xent.h:67
msgid ""
"Borrowed until the next `xent_settext` on this node, or until the node is"
" destroyed."
msgstr "借用指针有效至该节点下一次调用 `xent_settext` 或节点销毁为止。"

#: ../../../xent-core/include/xent/xent_text.h:27
msgid "Copies `text`. NULL is stored as an empty string. The caller may free it."
msgstr "拷贝 `text` （传入 NULL 时存为空字符串），调用方随后可释放原缓冲区。"

#: ../../../xent-core/include/xent/xent_text.h:36
msgid "Copies `family`. NULL or \"\" clears it. The caller may free it."
msgstr "拷贝 `family` （传入 NULL 或 \"\" 清空设置），调用方随后可释放原缓冲区。"

#: ../../../xent-core/include/xent/xent_text.h:43
msgid "Copies `runs` and each `font_family`. The caller may free the input."
msgstr "拷贝 `runs` 数组及每个 `font_family` 字符串，调用方随后可释放输入缓冲区。"

#: ../../../xent-core/include/xent/xent_measure.h:15
msgid ""
"Borrows `userdata` until `xent_node_clearmeasure` or the node is "
"destroyed."
msgstr "借用 `userdata` 直至调用 `xent_node_clearmeasure` 或节点销毁。"

#: ../../../xent-core/include/xent/xent_display.h:195
#: ../../../xent-core/include/xent/xent_display.h:199
msgid "Copies `utf8`. The caller may free it."
msgstr "拷贝 `utf8` 字符串，调用方随后可释放原缓冲区。"

#: ../../../xent-core/include/xent/xent_display.h:229
msgid ""
"Consumes `b`, including when a clip, transform, or opacity push is still "
"open."
msgstr "消费并结束构建器 `b` （即使仍有未闭合的裁剪、变换或透明度压栈状态）。"

#: ../../../xent-core/include/xent/xent_display.h:235
msgid "Points into `list` until `xent_dl_free`."
msgstr "返回指向 `list` 内部的只读指针，有效至调用 `xent_dl_free` 为止。"
